WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 3]

01:37.100 --> 01:38.180
What do you mean?

01:38.900 --> 01:42.140
Mr. Fan, do you want to investigate
the Baoyue Pleasure House?

01:42.420 --> 01:43.240
Who told you that?

01:43.260 --> 01:44.860
Not me.

01:45.820 --> 01:47.240
You came back from the dead

01:47.260 --> 01:48.600
and waited for me at this place.

01:48.620 --> 01:50.860
I suppose you can't be interested in me.

01:51.620 --> 01:53.340
I'm just an ordinary woman.

01:53.540 --> 01:57.060
Except for the Baoyue Pleasure House,
everything around me is ordinary.

01:58.060 --> 02:00.200
What's unusual about
the Baoyue Pleasure House, then?

02:00.200 --> 02:02.080
Although Baoyue Pleasure House
just opened not long ago,

02:02.100 --> 02:04.860
they've managed to recruit
the best courtesans in the Capital.

02:05.260 --> 02:06.860
All of them are famous courtesans.

02:07.260 --> 02:09.100
Each of the brothels had backers.

02:09.180 --> 02:12.080
Even so, none of them dared
to refuse their recruitment.

02:12.100 --> 02:13.460
That's not ordinary at all.

02:17.340 --> 02:19.160
Miss Sang, may I ask you for a favor?

02:19.180 --> 02:20.300
Mr. Fan,

02:20.340 --> 02:22.100
I wish to ask you for a favor as well.

02:22.580 --> 02:23.820
That's negotiable.

02:25.860 --> 02:27.440
If so, Mr. Fan, you should
keep the banknotes first.

02:27.440 --> 02:29.480
Only then will I be able to
bring up my request.

02:30.500 --> 02:32.140
What kind of favor do you need?

02:33.520 --> 02:34.980
Mr. Fan, you should ask me first.

02:35.140 --> 02:38.460
I won't bring up my request
if I can't help you out myself.

02:39.860 --> 02:42.080
Miss Sang, you do have
a good sense of self-awareness.

02:43.620 --> 02:45.040
With an identity like mine,

02:45.060 --> 02:47.900
I won't stand a chance
if I don't have any self-awareness.

02:48.880 --> 02:50.760
Who's the owner
of Baoyue Pleasure House?

02:52.940 --> 02:54.000
I don't know.

02:54.020 --> 02:55.860
I've never seen the owner

02:56.260 --> 02:58.000
ever since I joined
Baoyue Pleasure House.

02:58.020 --> 02:59.360
Let me ask you another question, then.

02:59.380 --> 03:01.780
Have you seen a pair of mother and son
in Baoyue Pleasure House?

03:01.800 --> 03:03.740
The child is around
six to seven years old.

03:05.460 --> 03:06.860
I have not.

03:09.260 --> 03:10.780
Mr. Fan, I assume the people
you're looking for

03:10.780 --> 03:12.560
didn't join Baoyue Pleasure House
of their own accords.

03:12.560 --> 03:14.260
No. They were abducted to it.

03:15.780 --> 03:17.300
We've never seen anyone

03:17.740 --> 03:19.140
whom they've abducted.

03:20.900 --> 03:23.400
If there's a pair
of mother and son in it,

03:23.420 --> 03:25.780
I assume they would be locked up
in the same place as the rest.

03:25.800 --> 03:26.900
Where is it, then?

03:30.060 --> 03:31.660
No one ever told us that before.

03:33.140 --> 03:34.860
We don't even know

03:34.940 --> 03:36.380
who their latest victim is.

03:37.780 --> 03:40.900
A few days ago, one of the girls
was harshly punished.

03:41.300 --> 03:43.540
She ran to the front yard
and bumped into me.

03:43.740 --> 03:45.440
If the pair of mother and son
were abducted to it,

03:45.460 --> 03:47.040
I think she might've seen them before.

03:47.060 --> 03:48.420
What's her name?

03:49.300 --> 03:50.460
I don't know.

03:50.620 --> 03:53.280
I think her surname is Jin.
That's all I know.

03:53.300 --> 03:55.040
And, her father
sells vegetables for a living.

03:55.060 --> 03:56.260
Miss Sang Wen,

03:56.940 --> 03:58.140
time to go.

03:58.780 --> 03:59.520
Okay.

03:59.540 --> 04:01.280
I'll be there after changing my outfit.

04:07.900 --> 04:08.980
Wait.

04:09.340 --> 04:11.420
You haven't told me about your request.

04:12.860 --> 04:14.140
Was my info useful?

04:14.380 --> 04:15.580
It was.

04:16.500 --> 04:18.300
I wish to leave Baoyue Pleasure House.

04:20.700 --> 04:22.700
It's dangerous for you
to come with me now.

04:22.900 --> 04:25.460
However, it's not that I can't bring you with me.

04:26.260 --> 04:27.540
But not now.

04:28.060 --> 04:29.920
I can never escape from this identity

04:29.940 --> 04:32.020
as long as my indenture is still there.

04:32.060 --> 04:33.780
If so, I'll buy out your indenture.

04:34.940 --> 04:36.760
Mr. Fan, I dare not ask you
to waste your money.

04:36.780 --> 04:38.360
I have enough to buy out my indenture.

04:38.380 --> 04:40.280
I just wish for a chance at redemption.

04:40.300 --> 04:42.420
You can't buy it out
even though you have the money?

04:42.820 --> 04:46.020
I was forced to sign the indenture
through violence.

04:46.700 --> 04:48.480
They're forcing women
to become courtesans now?

04:48.500 --> 04:52.220
The owner of Baoyue Pleasure House
is quite influential, huh?

04:56.180 --> 04:57.860
Don't tell anyone that you've seen me.

04:58.280 --> 04:59.660
Wait for me to rescue you.

05:01.260 --> 05:02.860
There's no rush.

05:03.020 --> 05:05.340
Mr. Fan, we can talk about it
once you've been revived.

05:11.700 --> 05:12.780
Your Highness,

05:13.700 --> 05:15.500
the name list of all individuals

05:15.520 --> 05:17.220
who attended the memorial service

05:17.260 --> 05:18.340
is here.

05:18.460 --> 05:20.100
Fan Xian never showed himself.

05:21.380 --> 05:23.740
Were there any movements
in Wang Qinian's residence?

05:24.820 --> 05:26.660
Not really.

05:29.060 --> 05:30.540
I've also planted our men

05:31.020 --> 05:33.460
at all corners.

05:33.940 --> 05:35.480
We only saw his wife and daughter.

05:35.500 --> 05:36.980
He was nowhere to be seen.

05:37.900 --> 05:39.220
Could it be

05:40.380 --> 05:42.340
that Fan Xian
hasn't reached the Capital yet?

05:43.300 --> 05:44.480
Should we wait a little longer?

05:44.500 --> 05:45.580
We have no time.

05:45.900 --> 05:48.020
Mr. Fan's death is known to all now.

05:48.060 --> 05:49.620
If he returns to the diplomatic corps,

05:49.620 --> 05:51.600
it'll be difficult to catch him.

05:51.620 --> 05:54.460
But he's not showing himself.

05:56.020 --> 05:57.100
Wujiu,

05:57.140 --> 05:58.540
did you know

05:58.580 --> 06:01.780
what the most touching moment
in the world is?

06:04.820 --> 06:06.540
To pass the imperial examination.

06:07.460 --> 06:09.300
It's reuniting with one's family.

06:10.820 --> 06:13.240
Did you know what the prerequisite is?

06:13.260 --> 06:14.480
You have to have a family first...

06:14.500 --> 06:17.220
You have to be separated first
before you can be reunited.

06:17.900 --> 06:18.980
Wujiu,

06:19.020 --> 06:21.220
invite Wang Qinian's
wife and daughter here.

06:21.380 --> 06:23.340
I wish to witness
their touching reunion.

06:24.060 --> 06:25.240
Yes, Your Highness.

06:32.380 --> 06:34.340
I'm waiting for that touching moment.

06:35.260 --> 06:37.540
Mr. Fan, I've already inquired about it.

06:37.940 --> 06:39.340
This is the street.

06:39.820 --> 06:40.680
Later,

06:40.700 --> 06:43.100
Baoyue Pleasure House's
purchasing caravan

06:43.140 --> 06:44.900
will pass by this road.

06:45.620 --> 06:46.860
Remember,

06:46.940 --> 06:49.880
there are two vegetable baskets
on the last cart.

06:49.900 --> 06:51.480
They aren't

06:51.500 --> 06:52.340
packed with vegetables.

06:52.340 --> 06:53.780
You can hide inside.

06:53.900 --> 06:54.760
Are you sure?

06:54.780 --> 06:55.860
Yes.

07:00.060 --> 07:01.220
They're here.

07:02.300 --> 07:03.620
Mr. Fan,

07:03.780 --> 07:06.220
do you have any spare changes?

07:33.260 --> 07:34.780
Look at all the silver taels!

07:34.940 --> 07:35.820
It's mine!

07:35.840 --> 07:37.420
There are silver taels over there!

07:37.700 --> 07:38.920
Go away! Don't steal my money!

07:38.940 --> 07:40.020
This is mine!

08:23.620 --> 08:25.560
To the west of the old fort,

08:25.580 --> 08:26.880
as the story goes,

08:26.900 --> 08:30.140
at Chibi, Zhou Yu of the Three Kingdoms

08:30.380 --> 08:31.460
summoned rocks to pierce the sky,

08:31.460 --> 08:33.480
[Baoyue Pleasure House]
waves to crash against the shore,

08:33.500 --> 08:35.220
and snow to pile up.

08:35.220 --> 08:37.020
Excellent!

08:40.580 --> 08:41.740
Get inside.

08:42.020 --> 08:43.100
Hurry up.

08:43.140 --> 08:44.540
Mind my goods.

08:45.500 --> 08:47.060
Go inside. Over there.

08:47.780 --> 08:49.740
Go inside. Be careful.

08:51.500 --> 08:52.580
Liu,

08:52.980 --> 08:54.080
inspect all these carts

08:54.100 --> 08:55.280
thoroughly later.

08:55.300 --> 08:55.900
Yes, sir.

08:55.920 --> 08:57.020
Yes, sir.

08:57.540 --> 08:58.780
Captain, take care.

09:07.550 --> 09:09.370
[Jin, Vegetable Seller In The Capital]

09:27.220 --> 09:28.420
I met you before.

09:30.140 --> 09:31.560
I don't know who you are.

09:31.580 --> 09:33.320
You were on the stage
before this, right?

09:33.340 --> 09:35.300
Everyone, please give me another chance!

09:35.660 --> 09:37.000
Please give me another chance!

09:37.020 --> 09:38.520
Please give me another chance!

09:38.540 --> 09:40.180
Please give me another chance!

09:41.060 --> 09:42.480
Do you wish to go inside that badly?

09:42.500 --> 09:44.420
It's more important than my life.

09:45.500 --> 09:46.960
You're not young anymore.

09:46.980 --> 09:48.420
You should mind your health.

09:50.260 --> 09:51.500
It doesn't matter.

09:52.380 --> 09:54.300
I'm fine with anything
that happens to me

09:55.100 --> 09:57.140
as long as I can see my daughter.

09:57.340 --> 09:59.120
Your daughter is
in Baoyue Pleasure House?

09:59.140 --> 10:00.220
But why?

10:04.150 --> 10:06.020
Because of 500 taels.

10:06.940 --> 10:08.400
Did you sell your daughter away?

10:08.420 --> 10:11.000
I would never do that
no matter how despicable I am.

10:11.020 --> 10:14.380
My daughter did it
to pay for the vegetable money.

10:15.020 --> 10:16.600
She sold herself away.

10:16.620 --> 10:19.500
Vegetable money? How on earth could
someone spend 500 taels on vegetables?

10:19.520 --> 10:21.660
It's the debt I incurred
from selling vegetables.

10:22.140 --> 10:24.500
Eunuch Dai, who's in charge
of purchasing vegetables,

10:24.500 --> 10:26.660
buys vegetables from me.

10:26.780 --> 10:27.860
Wait.

10:28.380 --> 10:31.000
Are you a vegetable seller?
Is your surname Jin?

10:31.020 --> 10:32.200
How did you know?

10:32.220 --> 10:33.400
- Leave it over here.
- Hurry.

10:33.420 --> 10:33.900
Okay.

10:33.900 --> 10:35.380
Careful.

10:35.620 --> 10:37.180
Mind the goods.

10:37.420 --> 10:38.660
I'll get a chicken.

10:53.420 --> 10:55.840
As you were saying, you delivered
vegetables to the palace, right?

10:55.860 --> 10:58.120
That's great. You'll have business
no matter the season.

10:58.140 --> 11:00.780
However, Eunuch Dai
charges us extra as a sign of respect.

11:01.500 --> 11:04.140
We have to pay him
on every festive occasion.

11:04.140 --> 11:05.660
On his last birthday,

11:05.860 --> 11:08.060
I had no money.

11:08.300 --> 11:09.760
Eunuch Dai held a grudge against me.

11:09.780 --> 11:13.660
After that, he kept complaining
that my vegetables weren't fresh.

11:13.800 --> 11:15.740
Wouldn't it be fine
if you just stopped selling them to him?

11:15.740 --> 11:17.940
If only that was the case.

11:18.500 --> 11:21.080
If they're not fresh,
he'll penalize you.

11:21.100 --> 11:23.240
He'll say that you're disrespecting
the imperial family.

11:23.260 --> 11:26.500
He penalized me every day.
I owed him money.

11:26.740 --> 11:29.000
My debt ended up becoming 500 taels.

11:29.020 --> 11:32.780
That's why my daughter
did such a silly thing.

11:32.800 --> 11:34.780
If so, can't you just stop
delivering vegetables to the palace?

11:34.780 --> 11:37.180
If you stop, that means
you're deceiving the ruler.

11:37.380 --> 11:39.900
You'll still be executed for that.

11:40.880 --> 11:43.200
So no one dares to file
a complaint against Eunuch Dai?

11:45.860 --> 11:47.620
I'm just a vegetable seller.

11:48.260 --> 11:50.020
How can I file a complaint against him?

11:50.140 --> 11:51.200
By using the law.

11:51.220 --> 11:53.140
Eunuch Dai is law himself.

11:53.160 --> 11:54.820
When my daughter sold herself away,

11:55.020 --> 11:58.260
I didn't even get the money.

11:58.580 --> 12:00.880
Baoyue Pleasure House gave Eunuch Dai
the money immediately.

12:00.900 --> 12:02.600
They said it canceled out my debt.

12:02.620 --> 12:05.420
Seems like Eunuch Dai
is quite close to Baoyue Pleasure House.

12:06.140 --> 12:09.260
Who knows? All of them
are influential figures.

12:09.620 --> 12:11.240
Since then,

12:11.260 --> 12:14.600
I always wanted to go inside
and visit my daughter.

12:14.620 --> 12:16.480
I wanted to tell her

12:16.500 --> 12:18.820
that I'm saving up money

12:19.380 --> 12:21.540
and that I'll definitely rescue her.

12:21.620 --> 12:24.600
Open the back door.
Let the caravan pass through.

12:24.620 --> 12:25.600
Check the backyard

12:25.620 --> 12:27.040
and see if you guys
missed out on anything.

12:27.060 --> 12:27.660
I'll help you out.

12:27.660 --> 12:28.900
Hurry!

12:37.620 --> 12:38.700
Mr. Fan.

12:40.420 --> 12:42.060
This is all of my private stash.

12:47.100 --> 12:48.300
Please take them.

12:49.540 --> 12:50.480
I can't just...

12:50.500 --> 12:51.660
Please take them.

12:56.260 --> 12:57.340
But...

13:00.580 --> 13:01.820
You don't need to kneel.

13:02.020 --> 13:03.100
You see,

13:03.140 --> 13:04.100
I'm using you too.

13:04.100 --> 13:05.420
I'm not helping you out.

13:08.900 --> 13:11.380
I can't go inside
even if I have the money.

13:11.780 --> 13:14.060
I need an invitation
before I can go inside.

13:14.100 --> 13:16.660
Hurry! Don't fall behind!

13:16.860 --> 13:17.940
Hurry up!

13:18.260 --> 13:19.340
Quick.

13:21.140 --> 13:22.500
I'll deal with that for you.

13:23.500 --> 13:28.000
It's said that suddenly
Jibei is recaptured;

13:28.020 --> 13:31.600
Weeds and trees in spring
grow unkempt in town.

13:31.620 --> 13:35.020
Flowers in this dark time
bring me tears and pains.

13:35.220 --> 13:36.640
Birds chirp sad partings...

13:36.660 --> 13:38.780
Hey, that's the wrong poem.

13:40.860 --> 13:43.260
We're going home
accompanied by the green spring.

13:43.540 --> 13:46.800
For three months,
war breaks out time and again;

13:46.820 --> 13:47.540
Letters from home...

13:47.540 --> 13:48.940
Why are you cheating?

13:53.380 --> 13:54.460
That's nonsense!

13:55.980 --> 13:58.180
Get off the stage!

14:01.260 --> 14:02.940
Mr. Fan.

14:04.300 --> 14:06.020
Your name lives forever!

14:07.140 --> 14:08.900
Why is this old man here again?

14:20.100 --> 14:21.420
What is he up to this time?

14:25.020 --> 14:26.420
He shows great momentum.

14:32.300 --> 14:33.760
He looks like he's doing something.

14:33.780 --> 14:34.860
Yeah.

14:47.260 --> 14:48.540
That was quick.

14:56.200 --> 14:57.920
It does resemble his handwriting!

14:58.980 --> 15:00.140
It does!

15:05.260 --> 15:06.280
It resembles his handwriting!

15:06.300 --> 15:11.420
Bravo!

15:14.500 --> 15:24.140
Bravo!

15:24.540 --> 15:26.060
Bravo!

15:28.020 --> 15:29.200
He won all votes.

15:29.220 --> 15:30.940
He shall receive an invitation.

15:32.260 --> 15:33.500
Next.

15:33.500 --> 15:34.220
Get on stage

15:34.220 --> 15:35.900
and show us how you mourn for him.

15:38.900 --> 15:40.500
"Say Farewell to My Friend, Dong."

15:41.020 --> 15:42.620
A thousand miles...

15:44.020 --> 15:45.780
A thousand miles...

15:46.780 --> 15:50.180
Next. Get on stage and show us
how you mourn for him.

15:55.075 --> 15:58.095
[Baoyue Pleasure House]

16:29.100 --> 16:30.540
Please head inside.

16:39.900 --> 16:41.000
Mr. Fan,

16:41.020 --> 16:42.480
he's truly lucky

16:42.500 --> 16:44.320
to have encountered you.

16:44.340 --> 16:46.780
Eunuch Dai, the person in charge
of replenishing the palace's vegetables,

16:46.780 --> 16:48.120
have you heard of him before?

16:48.140 --> 16:51.140
I've heard of him,
but I've never seen him before.

16:51.780 --> 16:53.240
I have to go and see him later.

16:53.260 --> 16:56.300
I have to find out what law looks like.

16:57.140 --> 16:59.120
Mr. Fan, if you wish
to climb up the ranks,

16:59.140 --> 17:01.900
you have to learn to be
as humble as the dust in the light.

17:02.100 --> 17:04.580
You have to learn
how to keep one eye closed.

17:05.500 --> 17:08.780
How could such a person
be known as the light?

17:09.300 --> 17:12.820
No matter if that's true or not,
he does work in the palace after all.

17:14.060 --> 17:15.940
Are affairs like Jin's actually common?

17:16.820 --> 17:18.340
They're common folks, you know?

17:18.700 --> 17:20.380
They're already used to it long ago.

17:23.780 --> 17:26.980
Mother, I'm not sleepy.
I don't want to take a nap.

17:28.060 --> 17:31.220
You can have dinner again
when you wake up.

17:31.260 --> 17:33.020
Do we have meat tonight?

17:33.980 --> 17:35.640
You can't just take meat all the time.

17:35.660 --> 17:37.060
I'd take rice too.

17:37.300 --> 17:39.060
Yeah. Go to sleep.

17:40.500 --> 17:41.620
Mother,

17:42.020 --> 17:45.780
why did Father and
Mr. Fan leave from the well?

17:47.740 --> 17:50.320
Don't tell anyone about your father

17:50.340 --> 17:52.580
and Mr. Fan, okay?

17:53.260 --> 17:54.080
I know that.

17:54.100 --> 17:55.480
Mother, don't worry.

17:55.500 --> 17:57.400
When I was playing with
Sanya and the rest,

17:57.420 --> 17:59.700
I told them Father was dead.

18:01.500 --> 18:03.300
You didn't need to resort to that.

18:06.020 --> 18:07.240
Is Father back?

18:07.260 --> 18:09.560
He doesn't need to knock on the door
when he comes back.

18:14.420 --> 18:15.580
Hide under the bed.

19:02.660 --> 19:03.400
Sir.

19:03.420 --> 19:05.000
Misters, please return.

19:05.020 --> 19:06.460
Please come back earlier tomorrow.

19:06.460 --> 19:08.060
Please go back.
We have another session tomorrow.

19:08.060 --> 19:09.740
Misters, please head back.

19:09.780 --> 19:11.580
That's all for today.
We have another session tomorrow.

19:11.580 --> 19:12.560
Please go home.

19:12.580 --> 19:13.940
Please go back.

19:14.580 --> 19:16.100
Misters, please go home.

19:16.460 --> 19:17.060
Please head back.

19:17.060 --> 19:18.240
Come back earlier tomorrow.

19:18.260 --> 19:19.340
Everyone,

19:19.540 --> 19:21.100
that's all for today.

19:21.540 --> 19:24.060
We'll continue the mourning tomorrow.

19:36.980 --> 19:38.180
Go now.

19:38.580 --> 19:39.920
Clean up that area.

19:39.940 --> 19:41.020
Okay.

20:13.500 --> 20:14.580
He's out.

20:16.600 --> 20:18.945
[Baoyue Pleasure House]

20:50.460 --> 20:51.620
How did it go?

20:54.340 --> 20:55.460
Well...

20:55.780 --> 20:57.700
Regarding your request,

20:58.300 --> 21:00.100
I already asked my daughter about it.

21:00.940 --> 21:04.820
She said she already saw
all the newcomers who were locked up.

21:05.740 --> 21:07.820
None of them had a son.

21:08.300 --> 21:09.740
Don't worry.

21:10.260 --> 21:12.020
The person you're looking for,

21:12.260 --> 21:13.940
she's not in Baoyue Pleasure House.

21:14.020 --> 21:15.560
If so, that means

21:15.580 --> 21:17.300
we have no leads now.

21:18.100 --> 21:19.220
My benefactor,

21:19.780 --> 21:23.180
you may give it a try tomorrow.

21:23.500 --> 21:24.620
What do you mean?

21:25.260 --> 21:26.940
My daughter said

21:27.180 --> 21:30.160
that they're lecturing the newcomers.

21:30.180 --> 21:33.500
They said that the owner
would be coming tomorrow morning.

21:33.580 --> 21:35.040
The owner of Baoyue Pleasure House, huh?

21:35.060 --> 21:36.780
He's quite mysterious.

21:37.100 --> 21:38.720
No one knows his identity.

21:38.740 --> 21:40.240
My benefactor, you have money.

21:40.260 --> 21:42.740
If you meet the owner,

21:43.260 --> 21:45.060
you can inquire about them from him.

21:47.060 --> 21:48.160
What about your daughter?

21:48.180 --> 21:49.700
Why didn't she leave with you?

21:53.780 --> 21:55.460
They said

21:56.540 --> 21:58.380
500 taels

21:59.060 --> 22:01.300
was only enough for four hours.

22:02.020 --> 22:04.480
They told me to proceed with

22:04.500 --> 22:06.860
my daughter's service with that amount.

22:12.460 --> 22:14.100
How much were they asking for?

22:17.940 --> 22:19.780
10,000 taels.

22:21.260 --> 22:22.540
I can never

22:22.540 --> 22:26.300
gather that money my entire life!

22:27.725 --> 22:28.580
[Baoyue Pleasure House]

22:28.580 --> 22:30.820
And, your 500 taels,

22:32.260 --> 22:35.020
I failed to take them back.

22:38.220 --> 22:40.740
Not only did I fail to save my daughter,

22:41.860 --> 22:45.780
but I also wasted your money.

22:47.220 --> 22:49.780
I'm so useless.

22:52.460 --> 22:53.960
Don't do this!

22:53.980 --> 22:54.860
I'm so sorry!

22:54.860 --> 22:55.420
Don't do this!

22:55.420 --> 22:56.840
You've already done me a huge favor.

22:56.860 --> 22:58.660
You don't need to return the 500 taels to me.

22:58.680 --> 23:00.540
Regarding the 10,000 taels,
I'll do something about it too.

23:00.540 --> 23:01.620
Don't worry.

23:06.820 --> 23:08.820
I'll go and sell my vegetables

23:11.060 --> 23:13.700
so that I can repay your debt.

23:18.220 --> 23:21.620
If only I could survive!

23:32.340 --> 23:33.420
Mr. Fan!

23:33.580 --> 23:35.020
Don't go there!

23:43.180 --> 23:44.260
Move out of the way!

23:44.260 --> 23:44.760
Go away!

23:44.780 --> 23:46.100
Mr. Fan, come on!

23:47.500 --> 23:50.280
Collect his corpse and report it
to the authorities. It's an accident.

23:50.300 --> 23:52.780
We'll pay however much we have to.

23:57.500 --> 23:58.920
If you rush outside,

23:58.940 --> 24:01.000
you'll only alert them
to your presence, Mr. Fan!

24:01.020 --> 24:01.980
Clean up the floor.

24:01.980 --> 24:03.260
Stop staring!

24:14.260 --> 24:16.300
This concerns an innocent life.

24:16.660 --> 24:17.860
How could a brothel do such a thing...

24:17.860 --> 24:19.940
The owner of the brothel
is the culprit here.

24:20.220 --> 24:21.980
All of you, leave. Stop looking.

24:22.060 --> 24:23.140
Go back.

24:23.420 --> 24:25.500
He went in alive.

24:25.980 --> 24:27.740
But he died after he came back out.

24:28.100 --> 24:29.960
Do you think
there's any other possibility?

24:29.980 --> 24:34.020
But we weren't inside just now.

24:39.100 --> 24:41.580
[Baoyue Pleasure House]
I'll definitely come here tomorrow.

24:41.860 --> 24:43.700
I want to see

24:44.260 --> 24:48.020
who exactly the owner
of Baoyue Pleasure House is.

24:52.650 --> 24:58.064
[Baoyue Pleasure House]

24:58.780 --> 25:00.680
What's with the heavy blow?

25:00.700 --> 25:02.320
The old man started it first.

25:02.340 --> 25:03.760
We had no choice.

25:03.780 --> 25:05.060
We had to defend ourselves.

25:05.080 --> 25:06.340
Where's his daughter?

25:06.420 --> 25:08.800
We're keeping an eye on her
to prevent her from taking her life.

25:08.820 --> 25:10.080
Have you washed the blood away?

25:10.100 --> 25:11.460
We have.

25:11.820 --> 25:12.940
The road is as good as new.

25:12.940 --> 25:14.540
- We cleaned the interior and exterior
- Your waist!

25:14.540 --> 25:16.760
thoroughly as per your instructions.

25:16.780 --> 25:19.500
We strive to be sincere,
just like what you taught us.

25:19.540 --> 25:21.000
Does he have any other family members?

25:21.020 --> 25:22.280
No. He only has one daughter.

25:22.300 --> 25:23.380
She's here with us.

25:24.260 --> 25:26.000
Deliver some money to her.

25:26.020 --> 25:28.280
Tell our men to look after her
and console her.

25:28.300 --> 25:29.740
Talk some sense into her.

25:29.780 --> 25:30.820
Now that her father is gone,

25:30.820 --> 25:32.320
I'm sure she's very upset.

25:32.340 --> 25:35.020
But it also makes things
easier for her, no?

25:35.040 --> 25:36.500
Keep your butt straight!

25:37.780 --> 25:39.740
Is your hand a chicken foot?

25:42.700 --> 25:43.800
Tell that girl

25:43.820 --> 25:46.860
that we'll hold a funeral
for her father.

25:47.260 --> 25:49.000
Tell her to work hard

25:49.020 --> 25:51.280
and become
a top courtesan in the future.

25:51.300 --> 25:52.840
At least the old man will be happy

25:52.860 --> 25:54.500
when he sees his daughter

25:54.500 --> 25:56.300
sweeping his tomb in the future.

25:56.980 --> 25:59.300
Madam Yuan, you're too kind.

25:59.940 --> 26:01.100
Again.

26:06.960 --> 26:08.260
Where are your waists?

26:08.780 --> 26:10.100
Raise your chests.

26:10.260 --> 26:11.460
Beautiful.

26:22.420 --> 26:23.500
Mr. Fan,

26:24.340 --> 26:25.500
according to what Jin said,

26:25.500 --> 26:27.160
Eunuch Dai of the Crop Inspection Bureau

26:27.180 --> 26:29.000
is the same as them.

26:29.020 --> 26:30.620
But don't worry.

26:30.740 --> 26:32.480
We can investigate him thoroughly

26:32.500 --> 26:34.100
once you've been revived.

26:35.300 --> 26:36.460
What's the matter?

26:42.340 --> 26:43.420
Dear?

26:46.980 --> 26:48.940
I searched the entire place.
She's nowhere to be seen.

26:48.960 --> 26:50.760
Could it be that
she's visiting her relatives?

26:50.780 --> 26:51.860
No way.

26:52.020 --> 26:53.040
My wife knew

26:53.060 --> 26:55.740
that your return
to the Capital was a secret.

26:58.580 --> 26:59.700
Baba!

27:11.860 --> 27:13.940
It's just like what happened
to the Teng family.

27:14.300 --> 27:15.580
They're gone.

27:23.540 --> 27:25.260
It must be Baoyue Pleasure House!

27:27.860 --> 27:29.100
Mr. Fan!

27:30.260 --> 27:32.020
It's pointless for you to go there now!

27:32.340 --> 27:33.420
Their lives

27:34.340 --> 27:37.300
are much more important than mine!

27:37.340 --> 27:38.340
Calm down. Listen to me first.

27:38.340 --> 27:39.740
What did you say?

27:40.460 --> 27:42.180
Didn't I tell you that we had to leave

27:42.180 --> 27:44.340
as soon as possible?

27:44.540 --> 27:47.280
If not, my wife and
my daughter would be in danger.

27:47.300 --> 27:48.700
Great.

27:48.740 --> 27:51.200
Second Prince has already captured them.

27:51.220 --> 27:54.720
How could I calm down at such a moment?

27:54.740 --> 27:57.820
This morning, we saw them
killing an old man

27:58.260 --> 28:00.780
right in front of our eyes!

28:04.020 --> 28:06.580
The world is bright and peaceful.

28:07.820 --> 28:10.780
All is well.

28:20.980 --> 28:22.780
Wang, I'll go now.

28:23.740 --> 28:25.020
Mr. Fan, take care.

28:25.460 --> 28:27.380
Keep an eye on the affairs out here.

28:27.700 --> 28:28.780
Yes, Mr. Fan.

28:30.260 --> 28:31.280
Don't worry.

28:31.300 --> 28:32.760
I can definitely rescue them.

28:32.780 --> 28:34.540
Mr. Fan, I trust you.

29:09.580 --> 29:10.780
Fan Wujiu.

29:11.220 --> 29:12.300
Your Highness.

29:16.180 --> 29:17.980
You're actually reading every day?

29:18.500 --> 29:20.380
You never did this before.

29:20.780 --> 29:22.180
The spring exam is nearing.

29:22.260 --> 29:23.940
I have to prepare myself.

29:24.540 --> 29:26.460
What? Do you plan to participate in it?

29:27.180 --> 29:30.300
All intellectuals
wish to pass the imperial examination.

29:30.500 --> 29:31.700
Intellectuals, huh?

29:31.840 --> 29:33.900
Why are you carrying
a sword with you, then?

29:35.060 --> 29:37.260
It wasn't my choice
to practice martial arts.

29:37.300 --> 29:41.220
Actually, I have been an intellectual
since young.

29:42.700 --> 29:43.820
Great.

29:44.100 --> 29:45.300
Excellent.

29:45.420 --> 29:47.380
At least you can
devise strategies for me.

29:47.820 --> 29:48.800
Come on, intellectual.

29:48.820 --> 29:50.020
Tell me something.

29:50.660 --> 29:52.780
Why did Wang Qinian's wife and daughter

29:53.500 --> 29:56.100
disappear out of the blue?

30:00.020 --> 30:01.300
Your Highness,

30:02.060 --> 30:03.620
I was perplexed by it too.

30:04.100 --> 30:08.680
Yesterday, I saw them entering
the Wang's Residence myself.

30:08.700 --> 30:10.020
Guess what happened

30:10.180 --> 30:11.460
when I rushed inside?

30:12.220 --> 30:13.500
They disappeared.

30:17.020 --> 30:18.700
Didn't they leave behind any traces?

30:19.780 --> 30:21.780
I searched the entire residence.

30:22.340 --> 30:23.780
But I found no traces of them.

30:24.500 --> 30:26.460
It's scary when I think of it.

30:26.580 --> 30:28.340
I thought I was dealing with spirits.

30:29.467 --> 30:32.227
Could it be that Wang Qinian
returned to the Capital with Fan Xian

30:32.540 --> 30:34.300
and moved them elsewhere?

30:35.860 --> 30:37.740
Considering what you've just said,

30:38.100 --> 30:39.660
everything does make sense now.

30:39.780 --> 30:40.860
You fool.

30:42.340 --> 30:43.020
Your Highness,

30:43.020 --> 30:44.520
Wang Qinian seeks an audience.

30:44.540 --> 30:45.620
Who?

30:45.820 --> 30:46.840
Did you say Wang Qinian?

30:46.860 --> 30:47.560
Yes, Your Highness.

30:47.580 --> 30:48.480
Is he alone?

30:48.500 --> 30:49.580
That's right.

30:50.980 --> 30:52.540
Interesting.

30:53.660 --> 30:54.360
Let him in.

30:54.380 --> 30:55.500
Yes, Your Highness.

31:12.300 --> 31:13.780
Greetings, Your Highness.

31:14.460 --> 31:15.780
I'm Wang Qinian.

31:23.780 --> 31:25.040
Where did you get this pear from?

31:25.060 --> 31:26.220
I bought it.

31:34.060 --> 31:35.460
What about some fruits?

31:36.820 --> 31:37.980
Fan Xian

31:38.820 --> 31:41.020
faked his death in the diplomatic corps.

31:42.260 --> 31:43.340
Now,

31:43.500 --> 31:45.060
he's in the Capital.

31:46.340 --> 31:47.420
Really?

31:48.220 --> 31:49.700
I'm glad to hear that.

31:50.340 --> 31:52.020
He actually managed to dupe me.

31:53.300 --> 31:55.020
After returning to the Capital,

31:56.300 --> 31:57.940
he's been trying to locate

31:58.260 --> 32:00.340
the whereabouts
of Teng Zijing's wife and son.

32:00.707 --> 32:01.787
Now,

32:02.420 --> 32:05.540
he has his sights on
Baoyue Pleasure House.

32:06.060 --> 32:07.540
What kind of place is that?

32:08.260 --> 32:09.460
It's a brothel.

32:10.140 --> 32:12.480
What has Baoyue Pleasure House
got to do with the mother and son?

32:12.500 --> 32:13.860
That doesn't matter.

32:14.580 --> 32:18.100
Fan Xian found out
that the owner of Baoyue Pleasure House

32:18.100 --> 32:19.980
was heading there today.

32:20.020 --> 32:21.760
That's why he snuck inside.

32:21.780 --> 32:24.006
Your Highness,
if you head there right now,

32:24.026 --> 32:26.760
you can expose
his fake death to the world

32:26.780 --> 32:28.300
and corner him.

32:32.260 --> 32:34.220
Aren't you Fan Xian's trusted aide?

32:39.020 --> 32:40.380
Mr. Fan

32:41.260 --> 32:42.500
did treat me

32:43.300 --> 32:44.940
like a great friend.

32:46.860 --> 32:48.120
I'm hugely indebted to him.

32:48.140 --> 32:49.740
Why are you betraying him, then?

32:56.940 --> 32:58.700
Your Highness, I only hope

32:58.940 --> 33:00.300
that you can release

33:00.820 --> 33:02.640
my wife and daughter
after the deed is done.

33:02.660 --> 33:04.260
So you're doing it for your family.

33:05.260 --> 33:06.780
In my heart,

33:07.300 --> 33:09.460
my wife and daughter are above all else.

33:21.020 --> 33:22.500
Can I trust you?

33:25.540 --> 33:26.440
All right.

33:26.460 --> 33:27.740
I promise you this.

33:27.820 --> 33:29.760
You can have any of my men

33:29.780 --> 33:31.300
as long as

33:31.780 --> 33:33.080
we can trap Mr. Fan today.

33:33.100 --> 33:34.460
Thank you, Your Highness.

33:35.780 --> 33:36.800
Wujiu,

33:36.820 --> 33:39.020
we shall head to
Baoyue Pleasure House together.

33:40.020 --> 33:41.260
Yes, Your Highness.

33:45.780 --> 33:46.860
Follow me.

33:49.100 --> 33:50.240
Where are my shoes?

33:50.260 --> 33:51.780
Where are my shoes?

33:59.580 --> 34:00.660
Your Highness.

34:16.220 --> 34:18.540
You do live up to your name
as Fan Xian's trusted aide.

34:19.460 --> 34:21.160
You forsook darkness for light.

34:21.180 --> 34:22.780
Fan Xian won't spare you.

34:22.940 --> 34:24.260
I don't have a choice.

34:25.180 --> 34:26.260
Get up.

34:28.300 --> 34:29.620
Get up!

34:32.260 --> 34:33.620
You have a choice now.

34:34.220 --> 34:35.920
Fan Xian's crime of deceiving the ruler

34:35.940 --> 34:38.580
will be confirmed
as long as we capture him today.

34:38.660 --> 34:39.640
By then,

34:39.660 --> 34:41.080
you can join me.

34:41.100 --> 34:43.420
I'll pay you as much as him.

34:43.460 --> 34:44.940
Thank you, Your Highness.

34:45.620 --> 34:47.180
If that's the case,

34:47.940 --> 34:49.780
why don't we flip the table entirely?

34:50.140 --> 34:52.300
Follow me to Baoyue Pleasure House.

34:55.540 --> 34:57.380
Your Highness, your wish is my command.

34:59.100 --> 35:00.780
Not bad at all.

35:05.140 --> 35:06.780
The owner doesn't come often.

35:07.220 --> 35:09.460
This is a rare chance for you all.

35:10.180 --> 35:12.660
Show him everything you learned.

35:13.340 --> 35:15.160
If he does take a liking to you,

35:15.180 --> 35:18.460
it'll be a great chance for you
to ascend to the top.

35:19.780 --> 35:22.700
However, I'll say this first.

35:23.060 --> 35:24.940
If anyone commits a mistake

35:25.180 --> 35:26.580
or gets into trouble,

35:26.860 --> 35:28.900
I'll remember the deed
for the rest of my life.

35:31.980 --> 35:33.140
Ladies,

35:33.940 --> 35:35.860
do your best.

35:43.660 --> 35:44.820
Miss Sang,

35:44.940 --> 35:46.860
you better sing well later.

35:47.140 --> 35:49.200
You mustn't sing gloomy songs.

35:49.220 --> 35:50.520
Miss Meng, please don't worry.

35:50.540 --> 35:51.900
I dare not do so.

35:53.740 --> 35:55.300
You must smile more often.

35:57.580 --> 35:58.720
That's the smile I want.

35:58.740 --> 36:00.300
It's great.

36:02.540 --> 36:05.780
Ladies, you all must think about

36:06.060 --> 36:08.180
how to serve him wholeheartedly.

36:08.620 --> 36:09.960
The brothel

36:09.980 --> 36:11.380
depends on you all now.

36:29.860 --> 36:30.940
Mr. Wang,

36:30.980 --> 36:32.420
be my chauffeur.

36:33.780 --> 36:34.860
Your Highness!

36:35.140 --> 36:36.280
Your Highness,

36:36.300 --> 36:38.660
please spare Mr. Fan!

36:43.300 --> 36:45.660
Why are you pleading for him now?

36:46.260 --> 36:48.420
I would never betray Mr. Fan

36:48.580 --> 36:50.820
if it weren't for the fact
that I had to save my family.

36:51.060 --> 36:51.880
Don't worry.

36:51.900 --> 36:53.920
I'm not doing all of these
so that I can kill him.

36:53.940 --> 36:55.860
Harmony benefits both sides after all.

36:56.420 --> 36:58.060
Thank you, Your Highness.

37:01.420 --> 37:02.860
Your Highness, to be honest,

37:02.980 --> 37:06.660
I'm pretty good at riding carriages.

37:12.025 --> 37:15.460
[Baoyue Pleasure House]

37:15.460 --> 37:18.040
We've cleared both the front
and back end of the street.

37:18.060 --> 37:19.220
Please don't worry.

37:30.060 --> 37:31.140
Here he comes.

37:46.900 --> 37:49.300
Greetings, sir.

38:08.980 --> 38:10.760
Don't make any mistakes later.

38:10.780 --> 38:14.500
I'm sure you all saw
how the newcomers were whipped.

38:14.900 --> 38:16.220
We all know that.

38:16.260 --> 38:18.840
It'll be terrible if the owner

38:18.860 --> 38:20.500
hears their wails.

38:20.520 --> 38:21.660
That won't happen.

38:21.700 --> 38:23.040
They're locked away in the backyard.

38:23.060 --> 38:25.200
Someone is keeping an eye on them.
They dare not make a sound.

38:25.220 --> 38:26.200
How would you know?

38:26.220 --> 38:28.640
I was chased away by the guards
when I passed by the backyard.

38:28.660 --> 38:29.820
I saw them back then.

38:37.420 --> 38:39.240
I think they were
all sold to the brothel.

38:39.260 --> 38:41.580
Why would a brothel
need this many newcomers?

38:41.580 --> 38:43.300
It's either they were
duped into joining the brothel

38:43.300 --> 38:45.140
or they were abducted here.

38:45.340 --> 38:47.680
If not, why would they cry every day?

38:47.700 --> 38:50.800
Well, who exactly is this owner?

38:50.820 --> 38:51.960
He's so cruel.

38:51.980 --> 38:53.240
Stop spouting nonsense.

38:53.260 --> 38:54.920
Mind your words if you want to live.

38:56.980 --> 38:59.940
Ladies, the owner is here.

39:07.620 --> 39:08.860
Over here, please.

39:12.380 --> 39:13.160
Mister.

39:13.180 --> 39:14.240
- Mister.
- Mister, you're here.

39:14.260 --> 39:14.960
Please.

39:14.980 --> 39:16.420
Why should I sit here?

39:16.620 --> 39:17.520
Try some grapes.

39:17.540 --> 39:18.140
I...

39:18.140 --> 39:18.860
Try mine.

39:18.860 --> 39:20.560
Try mine after this.

39:20.580 --> 39:21.720
- That's enough.
- Try this.

39:21.740 --> 39:23.080
Give it a try.

39:23.100 --> 39:23.720
Give it a try.

39:23.740 --> 39:24.820
That's enough!

39:25.740 --> 39:26.940
What is this?

39:27.300 --> 39:29.160
How can I have lunch
if I eat all of these?

39:29.180 --> 39:30.660
I'll check the ledgers first.

39:30.940 --> 39:33.920
Mister, the ledgers are ready.

39:33.940 --> 39:36.040
Why don't you check it
after our banquet?

39:36.060 --> 39:37.300
Where's the banquet?

39:37.420 --> 39:38.500
Is it this?

39:38.700 --> 39:40.200
It's not ready yet, right?

39:40.220 --> 39:41.260
I'll check the ledgers first.

39:41.260 --> 39:42.420
Where are they?

39:44.180 --> 39:45.500
Right now?

40:02.300 --> 40:03.995
[Fan Sizhe, Fan Jian's Second Son]

40:07.140 --> 40:08.260
Why are you still standing there?

40:08.280 --> 40:09.560
Why aren't you all leaving?

40:09.580 --> 40:10.860
You're obstructing me.

40:13.220 --> 40:14.120
You don't want any of them?

40:14.140 --> 40:16.760
Can they check the ledgers for me?
Or do they have numbers on their faces?

40:16.780 --> 40:17.960
You don't want any songs?

40:17.980 --> 40:19.640
What about a dance?

40:19.660 --> 40:22.300
Am I here to check the ledgers?
Or am I here to see them?

40:22.460 --> 40:24.500
Enough. Make them leave. Okay?

40:48.940 --> 40:50.780
What's with all these expenditures?

41:02.260 --> 41:04.740
What are you doing?
Why are you still here?

41:05.100 --> 41:06.660
I have to keep you company.

41:07.380 --> 41:08.920
Keep me company? But why?

41:08.940 --> 41:09.900
I'm here to chat with you.

41:09.920 --> 41:10.840
What should we chat about?

41:10.860 --> 41:12.460
What do you want to chat about?

41:15.700 --> 41:17.280
Don't try to pull this trick on me.

41:17.300 --> 41:18.780
I know what you're up to.

41:18.980 --> 41:20.320
I'm checking the ledgers here.

41:20.340 --> 41:22.720
And, you're here to distract me.

41:22.740 --> 41:24.680
I'm sure something's wrong
with the ledgers.

41:24.860 --> 41:26.640
You're accusing me here.

41:26.660 --> 41:28.140
If not, you should leave, then.

41:28.140 --> 41:29.220
Urge the kitchen to cook faster.

41:29.220 --> 41:30.060
I'm starving.

41:30.060 --> 41:31.600
I'm worried that you might be lonely.

41:31.620 --> 41:33.780
Look at all the ledgers
that are waiting for me.

41:33.780 --> 41:34.700
How could I be lonely?

41:34.700 --> 41:36.740
I'm the happiest man in the world now.

41:36.980 --> 41:39.680
Isn't it boring
checking the ledgers alone?

41:39.700 --> 41:40.860
What did you say?

41:43.260 --> 41:44.580
You infuriated me.

41:45.260 --> 41:48.600
Is there anything more interesting
than checking the ledgers?

41:48.620 --> 41:50.460
Get out. I don't want you here.

41:51.220 --> 41:53.060
How did I infuriate him?

41:53.220 --> 41:54.900
You thought you did a good job?

41:55.560 --> 41:56.640
Leave.

41:58.580 --> 41:59.880
Well, find me if you need anything.

41:59.900 --> 42:00.980
I'll be fine.

42:02.980 --> 42:04.140
Go now.

42:06.220 --> 42:08.180
How dare she badmouth the ledgers?

42:08.260 --> 42:09.380
She's so annoying.

42:22.860 --> 42:24.060
Fan Sizhe.

42:30.780 --> 42:32.220
Fan Xian?

42:41.180 --> 42:42.740
I knew you were still alive!

42:42.740 --> 42:43.900
Everyone said that you were dead.

42:43.900 --> 42:45.740
Why does it feel like it's been
a few years since I saw you?

42:45.740 --> 42:46.940
Lower your volume.

42:50.260 --> 42:52.520
Didn't you go to Northern Qi
as a diplomat?

42:52.540 --> 42:54.820
Why are you back
before the diplomatic corps?

42:55.860 --> 42:57.080
Did you get in trouble?

42:57.100 --> 42:59.180
Are you the owner
of Baoyue Pleasure House?

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.900
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.920 --> 44:03.320
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
